sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Reviewer (Streamlit)
    participant A as FastAPI
    participant P as Pipeline (code)
    participant C as Jev client
    participant J as Jev API

    U->>A: POST /triage {grievance}
    A->>P: triage_one(raw)
    P->>P: validate (Pydantic) + preprocess
    P->>C: ask(state, 23 questions)
    alt answer cached (replay or live)
        C-->>P: recorded answers
    else not cached
        loop up to 5 attempts on 408/429/5xx/529
            C->>J: POST /v1/systemone (model jev-1.13.0)
            J-->>C: probabilities + model + usage
        end
        C-->>P: answers, attempts, statuses
    end
    P->>P: thresholds → P1…P8 → audit block
    P-->>A: TriageOut
    A-->>U: decision + raw Jev answers
